eneric terms.\n- A piece on Pope Francis’ remarks during his England visit was refined to better capture his **cautious endorsement** of the Church’s approach.\n\n---\n• The *Salvator Mundi* controversy regarding its sale to Saudi Arabia and its subsequent **disputed authenticity** also prompted updates, alongside revisions to an opinion piece arguing how **UK Treasury policies might hinder tech innovation**.\n\n---\nP.P.S.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Section", "logprob": -1.5340304374694824}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.00022420754248742014}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.0002849888114724308}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.02757364884018898}, {"token": "Recent", "logprob": -1.4615263938903809}, {"token": " corrections", "logprob": -0.46215030550956726}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.6440528035163879}, {"token": " *", "logprob": -0.12335758656263351}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.003503139829263091}, {"token": " Guardian", "logprob": -0.0007653883076272905}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -0.0220673568546772}, {"token": " clarify", "logprob": -1.181868076324463}, {"token": " key", "logprob": -1.426770806312561}, {"token": " details", "logprob": -0.12963274121284485}, {"token": " from", "logprob": -1.248172640800476}, {"token": " several", "logprob": -1.5474058389663696}, {"token": " articles", "logprob": -0.21114182472229004}, {"token": " published", "logprob": -0.3300454020500183}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.448025107383728}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -1.1450932025909424}, {"token": "August", "logprob": -0.6340429186820984}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -5.960446742392378e-06}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.8013790142722428e-05}, {"token": "5", "logprob": -0.00010382589971413836}, {"token": "**.", "logprob": -0.9395750164985657}, {"token": " In", "logprob": -2.497837543487549}, {"token": " one", "logprob": -1.233587622642517}, {"token": " instance", "logprob": -0.6623939871788025}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.007255751173943281}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.7998